---
import "../../styles/animations.css";
---

<figure class="an-wrap">
  <svg class="an le" viewBox="0 0 480 290" role="img" aria-label="Worker 1 loses its lease while paused, worker 2 gets a newer token, and the stale write from worker 1 is rejected"><rect class="nd " x="16" y="24" width="120" height="70" rx="12"/><image href="/images/ruvio-mark-128.png" x="26" y="33" width="22" height="22"/><text class="b" x="87.0" y="49" text-anchor="middle">Worker 1</text><rect class="nd " x="16" y="166" width="120" height="70" rx="12"/><image href="/images/ruvio-mark-128.png" x="26" y="175" width="22" height="22"/><text class="b" x="87.0" y="191" text-anchor="middle">Worker 2</text><rect class="nd " x="180" y="95" width="110" height="76" rx="12"/><image href="/images/ruvio-mark-128.png" x="190" y="104" width="22" height="22"/><text class="b" x="246.0" y="120" text-anchor="middle">LEASE</text><rect class="nd " x="344" y="95" width="120" height="76" rx="12"/><image href="/images/ruvio-mark-128.png" x="354" y="104" width="22" height="22"/><text class="b" x="415.0" y="120" text-anchor="middle">Store</text><path class="ln" d="M136 59 L180 125"/><path class="ln" d="M136 201 L180 141"/><path class="ln" d="M290 133 L344 133"/><g class="le-w5"><text class="b" x="235" y="152" text-anchor="middle">token 41</text></g><g class="le-w2"><text class="b" x="235" y="152" text-anchor="middle">token 42</text></g><g class="le-w8"><text class="sm m" x="76" y="82" text-anchor="middle">paused…</text></g><g class="le-w0"><circle class="pk" cx="136" cy="59" r="5" fill="var(--c1)" style="--dx:44px;--dy:66px;animation-delay:0s;animation-duration:1.2s!important;"/></g><g class="le-w3"><circle class="pk" cx="136" cy="201" r="5" fill="var(--c2)" style="--dx:44px;--dy:-66px;animation-delay:0s;animation-duration:1.2s!important;"/></g><g class="le-w4"><circle class="pk" cx="136" cy="59" r="5" fill="var(--bad)" style="--dx:208px;--dy:74px;animation-delay:0s;animation-duration:1.6s!important;"/><text class="sm" x="400" y="82" text-anchor="middle" style="fill:var(--bad)">✕ stale 41</text></g><g class="le-w6"><circle class="pk" cx="290" cy="133" r="5" fill="var(--ok)" style="--dx:54px;--dy:0px;animation-delay:0s;animation-duration:1.2s!important;"/></g><rect class="cap" x="16" y="252" width="448" height="38" rx="10"/><g class="le-w0"><text x="240.0" y="276" text-anchor="middle">Worker 1 takes the lease and gets fencing token 41.</text></g><g class="le-w1"><text x="240.0" y="276" text-anchor="middle" style="fill:var(--bad)">Worker 1 stalls. The lease expires.</text></g><g class="le-w3"><text x="240.0" y="276" text-anchor="middle">Worker 2 takes it with token 42. Worker 1 wakes up…</text></g><g class="le-w4"><text x="240.0" y="276" text-anchor="middle">The store rejects the stale token 41. No split brain.</text></g><g class="le-w7 an-fin"><text x="240.0" y="276" text-anchor="middle" style="fill:var(--ok)">Only the holder of the newest token can write.</text></g></svg>
  <figcaption><b>Locks that stay safe when workers stall</b>Every LEASE returns a fencing token; a stale holder is rejected instead of corrupting data.</figcaption>
</figure>
